# GNOME Shell AppIndicator and KStatusNotifierItem Support extension.
#
# Vendored from https://github.com/ubuntu/gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
# pinned at commit bd6775ad627117d8397d82403c650e753a5514c1 (as used by
# ublue-os/bluefin). Provides the system tray used by the Caracal audio
# controller and other Qt AppIndicator apps on GNOME.
#
# Upstream license: GPL-2.0-or-later. Keep the upstream LICENSE file.
# After installing/updating, re-run `glib-compile-schemas` on schemas/ (see
# build_files/build-gnome-de.sh).